{title: Rim Jhim Gire Sawan}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Rimjhim Gire Sawan,
[Gm]Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C]Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C]lagi kaisi [Dm]yeh agan
[Dm]jab [Gm]ghungruon si,
[Gm]bajti [A]hai boondein
[A]armaan [Gm]hamaare,
[Gm]palkein [Dm]naa moondein
[Dm]kaise dekhen sapne nayan
[Gm]Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C]Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C]lagi kaisi [Dm]yeh agan
[Dm]Mahfil [Gm]mein kaise
[Gm]kahde [A]kisi se
[A]Dil bandh [Gm]raha hain
[Gm]ek [Dm]ajnabi se
[Dm]Haaye karein ab kya jatan,
[Gm]Sulag Sulag jaaye man
[C]Bheege aaj is mausam mein,
[C]lagi kaisi [Dm]yeh agan
